abstract: >-
  Industrial Control Research Platform (ICRP) is an independent research
  platform for governed industrial automation, deterministic control,
  embedded systems, HMI/SCADA, industrial protocols, simulation, fault
  injection, software factory acceptance testing, OT cybersecurity, evidence,
  and assurance-oriented engineering.
